                                                            <!--==h2 Start================-->
        <div class="h2-area">
            <div class="h2-area-in">
                <h2 id="35f77539">GLOBAL JAPAN PROGRAM</h2>
            </div>
        </div><!--//h2-area-->
        <!--==//h2 End================-->
    
                                            <!--==Text Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="txt-area-in clearfix ">
            Welcome to the Global Japan Program (GJP) offered by the International Institute for Japanese Language Education (IJLE). The GJP consists of the Japanese Language Course (JLC) and the Global Japan Studies Course (GJSC). <br />
Participating students are required to enroll in <span class="strong">at least 7 classroom hours per week (1 classroom hour = 90 minutes = 2 credits)</span> from JLC, GJSC, or a combination from both courses to obtain student visa status. (We do not, however, recommend that you enroll in more than 11 classroom hours per week.) 
        </div>
    </div><!--//txt-area-->
    <!--==//Text Area End===========-->

            
                <!--//ここまで1カラム//////////////////////-->
            </div>
            <!--//column-box-->
        </div>
        <!--//column1-->
    </div><!--//column-area-->
    <!--==//1Column End========================================-->

