                                                    <!--==Text Area Start===========-->
    <div class="txt-area clearfix clear">
        <div class="txt-area-in clearfix ">
            <span class="color-04"><span style="font-size:150%;">JAPANESE LANGUAGE COURSE (JLC) </span></span><br />
<br />
IJLE offers two types of Japanese language courses, namely the JL core courses and the JL elective courses. <br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:125%;"><span class="strong">JL Core Courses:</span></span><br />
<br />
JL core courses are intensive courses with the main objective of enabling students to acquire communication skills in speaking and writing. The students will be acquiring four major skills of the language (speaking, listening, writing and reading with Kanji). If you are planning on taking any Japanese language courses, you must enroll in one of the core courses. Upon your arrival, you will take an online placement test to determine to which level/core course you belong. The details of the JL core courses are summarized below as an example. These core courses are all offered in the morning from Monday to Thursday.<br />
<span style="font-size:110%;"><br />
<span class="strong"><span class="color-07">Tentative Curriculum</span></span></span><br />

        </div>
    </div><!--//txt-area-->
    <!--==//Text Area End===========-->

                                                
